                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lanzya meso aako kulibalubulansuki, ukabone. Sa kuli busena nibuba bumwi nkotana kulalikwa? Wakali kukala akubalindila kumbali lyanzila mbubonya mbuli mu-Arabiya munkanda, Wasofwaazya nyika mubwaamu bwabubi bwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
