        {
          "text": "Mumazuba ayo luzubo lwa-Juda luyooswanaana aluzubo lwa-Israyeli, nkabela boonse bayooboola antoomwe kuzwa kucisi cakunyika kusikila kunyika njindakapa bamausowanu kuti baivube.",
          "type": "text",
