        {
          "text": "Mebo ndakali kuyeeya kuti, Nkakubike mbuli mwanaangu, nkakupe nyika imbotu, caabilo cibotu kwiinda zyaabilo zyoonse zyabamasi! Ndakayeeya kuti ulandiita Taata, alimwi tokooyooleka kunditobela. ",
          "type": "text",
