                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulale mubweeme bwesu, ansoni yesu ituvumbe, nkaambo twabisizya Jehova Leza wesu, iswe abamatateesu, kuzwa kubwanike bwesu mane kusikila kubuzuba obuno. Tatuna kuswiilila ijwi lya-Jehova Leza wesu.",
